Greetings,

Thank you for the information.

Can you provide me with a timeline? I would like to know exactly what the
cost of storage and laundry reduction will be.

In addition, although I am not representing the other tenants I will be
providing them with assistance in contacting you and providing them with
the information that I have accumulated. Will the RTB be reaching out to
the tenants of 585 Corydon Ave or do you prefer that I provide you with
their contact information?

I've encoded the video files so that you can view them. Also, I've provided
you with images from a previous email which I'm glad I managed to document
before the landlord could 'clean up' evidence. Note: Each of the now
uninstalled units had markings indicated the suite they were correlated
with as seen in my images.

It is unfortunate that the RTB was unable to prevent this fraud from
occurring.

Thank you,
Evan Rosner

