<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Good morning,<u></u><u></u></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u></u>=C2=A0<u></u></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">There is currently drilling which is preventing me a=
