<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u></u>=C2=A0<u></u></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The measurements of the storage unit are 90 cm x 60<=
span style=3D"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody,serif">=C2=A0cm x 60=C2=A0c=
